  "id": "intrapsychic",
  "term": "intrapsychic",
  "definition": "Intrapsychic refers to something happening within a person’s own mind, especially in their internal beliefs or mental structures rather than in relationships between people. In this source, it describes a model of harm understood as damage to belief structures inside the person.",
